<title>UK: Lloyds TSB sets 300 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Lloyds TSB sets 300 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs International and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LLOYDS BANK PLC</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    18.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    18.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.40	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+55 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT GILT DUE DEC.2007</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
